  "statement": "Sustainability remains a priority, but I acknowledge the concerns raised regarding performance and safety. To address the conflicts, I propose modifying GRN-01 to focus on energy efficiency during peak loads rather than overall processing, allowing for better performance while still aiming for reduced energy consumption. Additionally, I suggest that GRN-02 can be implemented in phases to balance cloud adoption with local server efficiency. This way, we can ensure compliance with sustainability goals without compromising system responsiveness.",
