      "description": "The need for rapid transaction processing (EFF-01) and timely report generation (EFF-04) may conflict with energy efficiency measures (GRN-01), but a phased approach can mitigate this."
    },
    {
      "ids": ["SAF-06", "GRN-01"],
      "type": "logical",
      "description": "Ensuring energy efficiency (GRN-01) might lead to compromises in validating currency conversions (SAF-06), but focusing on peak loads can help balance both."
    }
